 "summary": "A P-channel enhancement MOSFET in the three-lead SOT-23, rated -20 V drain to source and -2.3 A continuous drain current with the ambient at 25 °C (-10 A pulsed). On-resistance is at most 112 mΩ with -4.5 V on the gate and 142 mΩ with -2.5 V; the gate threshold lies between -0.4 V and -1.0 V, and the gate is rated ±8 V. Uses named for it are battery-powered equipment, solid-state relays and direct drive from TTL or CMOS logic.",
